This licence covers the contents of this repository only: the emulator source,
the tools and tests, and the documentation, all of which are original work.

It does not, and cannot, cover anything the emulator runs. The Coleco ADAM and
ColecoVision firmware (OS-7, EOS, SmartWriter and the 6801 ROMs of the AdamNet
devices), the software on disks, data packs and cartridges, and every other
program or document mentioned here remain the property of their respective
rights holders. None of that material is contained in this repository; to run
anything you need your own copies.

src/vdpslots.h lists the TMS9918 VRAM access slots as read off the timing
diagram of Wouter Vermaelen's article "VDP VRAM timing" (openMSX, 2014), which
is built on Texas Instruments' 1978 master timing chart; the facts are theirs,
credited in README.md and docs/hardware_research.md.
